25
Flashback the recently dropped table by renaming it to EMP2_1.
(Flashback Table)
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------

sql> FLASHBACK TABLE EMP2
     TO BEFORE DROP
     RENAME TO EMP2_1;

Output:
-------

Flashback complete.


Verify:
-------

sql> SELECT * FROM EMP2_1;

Output:
-------

No rows selected.
